  "f06.fig_rates": {
   "callout": "The policy rate fell 2.58 points from 2024-08 to 2026-08. Savings passed on 0.38 of it (its offered beta is 0.38); time deposits passed on only 0.32 in the first year, because a certificate reprices only when it matures, and 0.66 by the end. Treasury's rate shocks use these betas.",
